      y: 0
      width: 456
      height: 330
    contents: 'Spawn: edit Rate directly.

      Output: edit Color / Size curves
      directly.

      Blackboard: SpeedMin / Max, LifetimeMin / Max, ParticleWidth
      / Length, Intensity, Noise.

      No runtime controller overrides. Linked
      gray fields receive values from these native nodes.'
    theme: Classic
